<title>USA: U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review -- June 13.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review -- June 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>National Sunflower Summary -- USDA Market News Service</p>
<p>Prices as of June 13, 1997</p>
<p>Weekly Trends: Sunflower Seeds were mostly 15 to 30 cents lower.</p>
<p>Sunflower Meal was mixed.</p>
<p>Sunflower Oil was fully steady.</p>
